  answer: Bill Haley & His Comets
  acceptedAnswers:
  - Bill Haley & His Comets
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABRazzle Dazzle\xBB, de 1955, y llega hasta
    1991."
  - "\xABNew Rock The Joint\xBB presenta una energ\xEDa alta y un pulso cercano a
    142 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABShake, Rattle And Roll - Single Version\xBB
    y \xAB(We're Gonna) Rock Around The Clock - Single Version\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABShake, Rattle And Roll\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xAB(We're Gonna) Rock Around The Clock\xBB
    y \xABSee You Later, Alligator\xBB."
